# What `gcloud run deploy --source src/frontend` uploads for the WEB image.
#
# Explicit for the same reason as the root copy: deterministic, and gcloud does
# not then write its own.
#
# .env.local matters most here. scripts/dev.sh regenerates it on every local run
# with NEEV_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000, and Next reads .env.local at build
# and at runtime -- so shipping it would point every deployed page at a backend
# that does not exist inside the container. The deployed value arrives through
# --set-env-vars instead.

.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.local.example

node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.log
.DS_Store
